1
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,160
Great.

2
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,570
I'll bring it back for testing right away.

3
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,120
You brat.

4
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:41,600
Are you okay?

5
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,960
They give me maintenance doses regularly.

6
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,360
Don't worry, I won't die.

7
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,260
Thanks for your hard work.

8
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,560
By the way, Master.

9
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,360
How is the investigation going?

10
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,440
No progress.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,840
There have been a few more victims
recently.

12
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,920
Some are beggars.

13
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:58,920
Some are dock workers.

14
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,120
And some are orphans.

15
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,840
These people either went missing

16
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:02,680
or died.

17
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,690
They all died in a miserable state.

18
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:08,240
I suspect they took drugs
before they died.

19
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:10,240
It should be a new type of drug.

20
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,720
Perhaps,

21
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,480
this is it.

22
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,060
We couldn't find a sample before.

23
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,260
Now we have one.

24
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:22,080
The Shisha Gang is closely related
to this.

25
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,880
Once I gain Xu Qingdao's trust,

26
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:27,250
I should be able to get more
inside information.

27
00:01:27,250 --> 00:01:27,930
By the way.

28
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:33,360
What exactly happened
the day Lu Wenbiao died?

29
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:38,240
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 8]

30
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:41,120
At that time, the bureau received news

31
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:44,440
that Lu Wenbiao was smuggling drugs
and preparing to abscond,

32
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,680
so I went after him.

33
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:49,960
But Lu Wenbiao was very calm.

34
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,640
I found it a bit strange

35
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:54,210
and wanted to interrogate him.

36
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:56,479
So I didn't want to shoot him at the time.

37
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:57,880
I even missed on purpose.

38
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:00,680
However,

39
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,600
from the same angle...

40
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,400
Someone fired a shot.

41
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,479
I checked that gun.

42
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,720
It was tampered with.

43
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,200
The bullets were also replaced.

44
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:17,250
Master, did you find out who it was?

45
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,240
Not yet.

46
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:20,780
But it proves our guess was right.

47
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,940
There is indeed a mole
in the police department.

48
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,720
Fortunately, he should've believed

49
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,120
the act we put on earlier,

50
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,720
that we have turned against each other.

51
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,800
When he lets his guard down,

52
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:36,280
he will definitely expose himself.

53
00:02:38,329 --> 00:02:39,030
Also,

54
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,520
after the goods Lu Wenbiao transported

55
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,320
were confiscated by the police,

56
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,880
the warehouse inexplicably exploded.

57
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:45,960
Nothing was left.

58
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,360
Do you think he transported it
voluntarily?

59
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,680
Given Old Chief Lu's character,

60
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,000
he wouldn't do this.

61
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,760
I think so too.

62
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:05,520
Lu Wenbiao's drug trafficking incident
is not that simple.

63
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,460
You brat.

64
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,780
You even copy this.

65
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,440
Tell me about you.

66
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,329
How are you doing at Lu Ye's?

67
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:23,120
Seems not so well.

68
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:27,680
He hates me.

69
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,640
Hate.

70
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,200
It's good to be young.

71
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,460
You still have the energy to hate.

72
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,600
That kid has some tricks.

73
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,480
You be careful.

74
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:42,200
Got it, Master.

75
00:03:43,079 --> 00:03:44,200
However,

76
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,300
being careful is useless.

77
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,280
He won't let me go.

78
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,700
By the way, Master.

79
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,380
What about that batch of arms?

80
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,240
Leave it to me.

81
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:01,120
You don't need to worry about it.

82
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,600
Young Master.

83
00:04:14,230 --> 00:04:16,380
The arms at the train station,
as you ordered,

84
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:18,579
have been distributed to the branches.

85
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:19,880
Young Master.

86
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:22,940
You have truly become the man Master
expected you to be.

87
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:25,600
People change.

88
00:04:27,090 --> 00:04:29,090
Just like the skies over Ningcheng.

89
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:31,580
They’re about to change too.

90
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,720
You've got some nerve,

91
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:14,440
cooking the books in front of me.

92
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:19,280
Damn it, that cop!

93
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,130
Stealing my thunder as soon as he arrives.

94
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,640
Just wait.

95
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,200
Let's go.

96
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,200
To Tianjiu Alley.

97
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,360
Hui.

98
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:30,420
Isn't that the Qingtian Gang's
most valued territory?

99
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:36,920
I haven't settled the score with Lu Ye
from last time.

100
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:40,100
I'm going to slap him hard in the face.

101
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,040
I want everyone to see

102
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:46,440
that Shen Tianbai isn't the only one
in the Shisha Gang who can fight.

103
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,440
What are you doing?

104
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,040
Step back.

105
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,400
Get lost.

106
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,870
Hui.

107
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:58,260
What do you mean by sealing this well?

108
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:01,440
The water from the well in Tianjiu Alley,

109
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,760
you've all drunk it, right?

110
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:03,560
Yes.

111
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,560
Is it sweet?

112
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:08,560
Do you know why it's so sweet?

113
00:06:08,650 --> 00:06:11,090
Because under Tianjiu Alley

114
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:13,800
buries the ancestors of our Shisha Gang.

115
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,960
Drinking the water from this well

116
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:19,180
is like sucking the blood
of our Shisha Gang.

117
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:22,360
It's not too much to ask you
to pay some money, is it?

118
00:06:22,590 --> 00:06:23,390
What?

119
00:06:23,550 --> 00:06:24,750
We have to pay?

120
00:06:25,210 --> 00:06:26,200
How could we afford it?

121
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:28,000
I'll let you off easy today.

122
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:30,120
I won't charge per person.

123
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:33,760
Half a silver dollar per household
every week.

124
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,640
How about that?

125
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,000
Half a silver dollar?

126
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,930
How could we possibly afford that?

127
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:39,659
Hui,

128
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:42,000
we all run small businesses.

129
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:44,320
Please have mercy on us.

130
00:06:47,860 --> 00:06:49,240
That's none of my business.

131
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:52,280
If you can't pay, use the land
to settle the debt.

132
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,400
Hui,

133
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:57,320
this used to be the territory of Chief Lu
of the Qingtian Gang.

134
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,840
How do we use it to pay the debt?

135
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,920
Lu Wenbiao has been dead for a long time.

136
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,940
No one is protecting you anymore.

137
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:07,400
Either pay up or get lost.

138
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,320
I'm laying it on the line today.

139
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,000
Tomorrow,

140
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,880
if I don't see the money,

141
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,560
I'll make you suffer.

142
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,520
Hui...

143
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,780
Poor bastards.

144
00:07:20,900 --> 00:07:21,820
Hui...

145
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:22,800
Let's go.

146
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:25,960
Young Master.

147
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:29,240
The Shisha Gang went to the Tianjiu Alley
to collect protection fees.

148
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,840
They even charge for a sip of water.

149
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:33,040
The people living in there are all poor.

150
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,760
The old chief used to protect them.

151
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:35,720
As soon as he passed,

152
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,360
the Shisha Gang went to stir up trouble.

153
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,000
This is really going too far.

154
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:40,560
Who did it?

155
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:41,390
Hui.

156
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:45,010
He sure knows how to calculate.

157
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,040
First, he extorts money,

158
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,440
getting as much as he can.

159
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,040
Once everyone is driven away,

160
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:51,640
that territory will belong
to the Shisha Gang.

161
00:07:53,010 --> 00:07:54,340
You really are capable.

162
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,320
You've only been in there for a few days,

163
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:58,720
and you've already caused so much trouble.

164
00:07:59,010 --> 00:08:02,010
Do you mean this has something to do
with Shen Tianbai?

165
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:05,400
He's been showing off in the Shisha Gang,

166
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:07,400
becoming Xu Qingdao's right-hand man.

167
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,660
Others naturally feel a sense of crisis.

168
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:14,000
When people panic, they tend to do
stupid things.

169
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:17,320
Then, how should we handle this?

170
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,290
Give them money.

171
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:22,940
Give him the money.

172
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:44,080
I guessed it right.

173
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,680
Hui, you haven't changed a bit
over the decades.

174
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,340
As soon as you make some money,

175
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,240
you come to Dashijie to have fun.

176
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:52,240
Look who it is.

177
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:56,080
Isn't it Young Master Lu?

178
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,680
What?

179
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,700
Is the Qingtian Gang out of money,

180
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,820
so they sent you to shine shoes again?

181
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,080
Give me a shine.

182
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,680
If you do a good job,

183
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,920
I'll reward you with a drink.

184
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:23,600
Let me buy you a drink today, Hui.

185
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:26,880
You what?

186
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:45,840
You're awake.

187
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:49,680
The knockout drops of our Qingtian Gang
work pretty well, right?

188
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:50,520
You brat.

189
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,560
You dare to tie me up?

190
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,080
I'll make you pay for this.

191
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,680
Collecting money in Tianjiu Alley,

192
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:58,240
did you have fun?

193
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:00,400
So it's about this.

194
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:01,810
Why?

195
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:05,480
You still think that's
the Qingtian Gang's territory?

196
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,340
I collected the money.

197
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,810
I had a great time!

198
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,520
Glad you had fun.

199
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:17,120
After all, it's the price for your life.

200
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,720
Lu Ye, what are you doing?

201
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:40,820
I heard Hui slapped the Qingtian Gang
in the face at Tianjiu Alley.

202
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,280
That's so satisfying.

203
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:47,040
But why hasn't Hui come back yet?

204
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:04,460
There's something wrong with this wine.

205
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:07,720
Lu Ye.

206
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,400
What are you doing?

207
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,880
Don't you like water?

208
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:13,060
Then I'll let you drink your fill.

209
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,880
If I die,

210
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:26,660
the Shisha Gang won't let you off.

211
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,880
Then I'll be waiting.

212
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,040
Don't worry.

213
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:32,280
When that day comes,
I'll burn paper money to tell you.

214
00:11:32,930 --> 00:11:33,490
You...

215
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,040
You're a madman.

216
00:11:36,780 --> 00:11:38,020
You just found out?

217
00:11:38,210 --> 00:11:39,870
Didn't Shen Tianbai tell you?

218
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,280
It's time to go.

219
00:11:55,890 --> 00:11:57,170
Let him go.

220
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,320
You got here fast.

221
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,560
You really have a dog's nose.

222
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,600
Get out of the way.

223
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,000
Shen Tianbai.

224
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,320
Do you know why I want to kill him?

225
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:26,040
He broke into Tianjiu Alley,

226
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,800
collecting protection money
from every household,

227
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:29,330
half a silver dollar a week.

228
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,640
Who lives in Tianjiu Alley?

229
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:33,990
Shen Tianbai.

230
00:12:34,010 --> 00:12:35,610
You should know better than me.
